{"id":"en_stolen-identity-bitter-revenge","title":"Stolen Identity, Bitter Revenge","titleEn":"Stolen Identity, Bitter Revenge","description":"On a stormy night, Mu Jinhe, eldest daughter of the Mu family, and her son-in-law Zhou Jianguo celebrated the birth of a child they named Mu Weiyi, meant to be the family's sole heir. But Zhou Nian, Mu Jinhe's adopted daughter, was gripped by jealousy, afraid of losing her mother's affection. She engineered an accident during the delivery that caused Mu Jinhe to give birth prematurely and fall into a coma, then abducted the newborn to secure the Mu family's love and fortune for herself.\n\nMeanwhile, Qin Shu, Zhou Jianguo's former lover whom he had abandoned, learned the truth. Furious, she confronted him at his door and was humiliated and turned away. She realized her biological daughter, Zhou Nian, had become the Mu family's adopted child and that Zhou Jianguo was exploiting her to strengt","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/stolen-identity-bitter-revenge/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/stolen-identity-bitter-revenge/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Glow-Up","Mistaken Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dj1d8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_stolen-identity-bitter-revenge_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dj1d8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stolen-identity-bitter-revenge_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dj1d8/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_stolen-identity-bitter-revenge_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumb